sentences.text:
By way of the present petition, the petitioners are seeking following reliefs :
"(A) Your Lordships may be pleased to issue appropriate writ, order or be pleased to quash and set aside FIR being C.R. No.11821001230442 of 2023 dated 13.12.2023 filed before the Randhikpur Police Station, Dis: Dahod for the offences punishable under Sections 376 of the Indian Penal Code and other consequential proceedings arising out of the FIR, in the interest of justice;
(B) Your Lordships may be pleased to pass an order and be pleased to stay further proceeding in connectin with FIR being C.R. No.11821001230442 of 2023 dated 13.12.2023 filed before the Randhikpur Police Station, Dis: Dahod for the offences punishable under Sections 376 of the Indian Penal Code and other consequential proceedings arising out of the FIR;
Ramsubhai Chaturbhai Amliyar vs State Of Gujarat on 15 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/96028886/
1

(D) Your Lordships may be pleased to release the petitioenr in connection with the FIR being C.R. No.11821001230442 of 2023 dated 13.12.2023 filed before the Randhikpur Police Station, Dis: Dahod;
(E) Your Lordships may be pleased to dispense with the filing of the affidavit as the applicant is in jail, in the interest of justice;
2. Heard learned advocates for the respective parties.

